# Cross-Org Migration Scope — environment template.
#
# The solution itself requires no secrets: both agents ship with builtin
# tools only. Add entries here as you connect real tooling to the
# installed agents. The GitHub App binding (enablement/github_app, on
# the Researcher and optionally the Orchestrator) gives READ access to
# the shared paper-test repo in hosted and local astrorun sessions
# alike — bind it and start a fresh session. Branch/commit/PR WRITES
# use the local `gh` login on the astrorun machine; for hosted writes,
# connect a write-capable tool (custom tool or MCP server) and put its
# secrets here.
